  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d12f67820ba484488a4e5e3be56da97e, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "Climate Technologies Institute  The Climate Technologies Institute
    concentrates on climate change mitigation and adaptation technologies. Its mission
    includes developing tools to monitor climate and weather, technologies to adapt
    infrastructure and agriculture to changing climate conditions, and methods to
    reduce climate-related risks. Key focus areas are climate modeling and simulation,
    renewable energy integration (since it helps cut greenhouse gases), weather modification
    research (like cloud seeding), and climate-smart urban planning. The institute
    aims to support Saudi Arabia\u2019s efforts in addressing climate challenges
    \u2013 such as desertification, extreme heat, and erratic rainfall \u2013 by
    innovating practical solutions and providing data for informed policy"
